  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 236, 'Browse a free online collection of ancient pottery and pick the shape you find loveliest.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 237, 'Pause in the evening to see how lamplight from windows glows along your street.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 238, 'Dance to one song in your living room, however you like, with no one watching.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 239, 'Pick a simple color scheme, like green and white, for the next holiday or birthday table you set.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 240, 'Recreate a famous painting from long ago at home with household objects, then take a photo.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 241, 'Give one piece of lobby art, in an office, clinic or bank, a real look instead of walking past.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 242, 'Linger by a rack of seed packets in a garden shop and enjoy the painted flowers on each one.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 243, 'Name a song that feels like your favorite season and play it when that season arrives.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 244, 'Nudge one piece of furniture a little so the room opens up or a nicer view comes into sight.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 245, 'Sketch the view from a window at dawn or dusk, using only a pencil.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 246, 'Find a painting with an animal tucked into a corner, a dog, a cat or a bird, and enjoy the small surprise.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 247, 'Pick a window you pass often and notice what changes in it from season to season.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 248, 'Bring a little music to a summer picnic or porch evening by playing one gentle song for everyone.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 249, 'Swap one plastic container on your counter for a glass or ceramic one you already have.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 250, 'Fold a simple paper crane, star or boat and set it somewhere you will see it.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 251, 'Picture the artist at work on a painting you like, and wonder what the room smelled like.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 252, 'Consider one public place you pass through, a station, a plaza or a park path, and what makes it pleasant.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 253, 'Go find a recording of an orchestra tuning up and enjoy that rich jumble of sound before the music begins.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 254, 'Start a small jar of buttons, marbles or beads simply because the colors are lovely.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 255, 'Pick a color you rarely use and make something small with it, a doodle, a pattern or a stripe.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 256, 'Spot one place in a painting where two colors meet, and see whether the edge is soft or sharp.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 257, 'Notice the shape of each tree''s silhouette on your street once the leaves have fallen.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 258, 'Read a rhyming picture book and enjoy the music of the words, with or without a child.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 259, 'Leave a pretty notebook and pen out on a table for anyone at home to doodle or write in.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 260, 'Try drawing with your other hand and enjoy how strange and lively the lines look.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 261, 'Pick a photograph from an old family album and look at it as you would a work of art.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 262, 'Spot the first red or orange leaves of autumn and stop for a closer look.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 263, 'Play one song your parents or grandparents loved and think of them while it plays.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 264, 'Look at your front door from the street and add one welcoming touch, like a wreath or a potted plant.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 265, 'Cut a paper snowflake on a winter evening and tape it to a window.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 266, 'Spend a fall morning with a painting of harvest fields and enjoy all its golds and browns.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 267, 'Glance at a clock face or watch dial and enjoy its numbers, hands and tiny marks.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 268, 'Try listening to one piece of jazz and follow how the players pass the melody around.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 269, 'Hang a calendar with pictures you love and turn each page with a little ceremony.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 270, 'Look closely at old Japanese woodblock prints or Indian miniature paintings online and notice the details.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 271, 'Look for repeated shapes in an abstract painting, circles, squares or curves, and follow them around.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 272, 'Enjoy the shapes of the clouds over your rooftop for a few minutes in the late afternoon.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 273, 'Savor the quiet for one minute after a song ends before you play the next.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 274, 'Display a pretty empty bottle or tin you would usually throw away, cleaned and set on a shelf.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 275, 'Point out a beautiful sky to whoever you are with, simply by saying "look."'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 276, 'Find a painting with a window in it and imagine what lies just outside the frame.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 277, 'Run your eyes along the rows of a library shelf and enjoy the patchwork of spines.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 278, 'Tune in to a short clip of a tap dancer and listen to the feet as music.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 279, 'Plant a few seeds in a small pot on the windowsill this spring.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 280, 'Record a short video of leaves moving in the wind and send it to someone.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 281, 'Enjoy an old travel poster online and notice how a few bold shapes make you want to be there.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 282, 'Browse the colors of the produce at a market as if the piles of fruit were a painting.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 283, 'Look up the story behind a song you love, then listen again knowing it.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 284, 'Water your plants slowly and pinch off one dry leaf so they look their best.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 285, 'Craft a small bookmark from card and ribbon and tuck it into a book you plan to lend.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 286, 'Pick an artwork made of cut or folded paper and admire how crisp and patient its edges are.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 287, 'Sit by a window on a cold morning and watch the pale winter light change.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 288, 'Write a haiku about something lovely you heard today, with no skill needed.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 289, 'Give a tired houseplant a prettier pot from your cupboard, even an old teacup.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 290, 'Sketch a picture in the sand at a beach or playground with a stick and let it go.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 291, 'Consider how a photographer used empty space in one picture, and what the emptiness adds.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 292, 'Take in the colors of a summer thunderstorm sky from indoors, the deep grays and sudden bright edges.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 293, 'Pick a song with a clear story and listen as if it were a tiny play, with a beginning, middle and end.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 294, 'Paint one old flowerpot in a bright color for a balcony or doorstep.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 295, 'Create a tiny flip book from a pad of sticky notes, with a stick figure that waves.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 296, 'Trace the outline of a sculpture in the air with your finger as you look at it.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 297, 'Ask a family member about a beautiful object in their home and the story behind it.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 298, 'Save a voice message from someone you love singing or laughing, and play it back on a quiet evening.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 299, 'Run a ribbon or a string of beads along a shelf edge for a little sparkle.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 300, 'Teach someone a simple craft you know, like a friendship knot or a string game.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 301, 'Enjoy a painting of a quiet room, a kitchen or a bedroom, and notice the small objects in it.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 302, 'Stand on a footbridge or a quiet overlook and take in the shapes of the city or land below.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 303, 'Join in the singing at a birthday or holiday gathering without worrying about your voice.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 304, 'Rotate the things on your mantel or dresser so you see them with fresh eyes.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 305, 'Help a child build a cardboard castle or fort and decorate it together.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 306, 'Watch a short free video of a conservator cleaning an old painting and see the colors come back.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 307, 'Admire a handmade object you own, a mug, a blanket or a basket, and the hands that made it.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 308, 'Read a short poem to someone you live with, or over the phone to a friend.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 309, 'Gather loose photos, tickets and keepsakes into one pretty box so they are easy to enjoy.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 310, 'Celebrate a holiday from another culture by learning about its traditional art or decorations.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 311, 'Rest your eyes on one artwork before bed instead of scrolling, and let it be the last thing you see.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 312, 'Turn off the overhead light at dusk, switch on one lamp, and see how the room softens.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 313, 'Notice a poem posted on a bus, in a station or on a library wall, and read it all the way through.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 314, 'Brighten a gray winter room with one yellow or red object you already own.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 315, 'Bring a small handmade thing to work and explain why it feels lovely to you.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 316, 'Notice the sky in a landscape painting and how much of the canvas the artist gave to it.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 317, 'Find beauty in something worn, a scuffed step or a faded sign, and enjoy the history it holds.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 318, 'Set your alarm to a song you find beautiful instead of a harsh beep.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 319, 'Tidy the icons on your phone or computer screen so the picture behind them can show.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 320, 'Draw a quick portrait of a pet or someone you love from a photo, with no worry about likeness.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 321, 'Leave a kind note in a gallery guest book about one piece that moved you.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 322, 'Pause over the rings and swirls inside a cut cabbage, onion or orange while you cook.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 323, 'Imagine colors while listening to an instrumental track, and notice which ones appear.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 324, 'Replace a worn drawer knob, shoelace or lamp pull with a prettier one you already own.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 325, 'Photograph the same corner of a room in the morning and the evening and compare the light.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 326, 'Locate the light source in a painting, a candle, a window or the sun, and follow where it falls.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 327, 'Hunt for a face hidden in an everyday object, like a house with two windows and a door for a mouth.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 328, 'Dim the lights on a winter evening and listen to a quiet piece of string music.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 329, 'Place wind chimes near a door or window where you can hear them on a breezy day.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 330, 'Make a playlist of songs you find beautiful and share it with someone.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 331, 'Visit a small historic house or local history museum and notice the art hanging on its walls.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 332, 'See how many shades of green you can find in a single bush, hedge or patch of lawn.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 333, 'Stream a free recorded theater performance online and watch the first act.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 334, 'Keep a bowl by the door for small treasures from walks: an acorn, a pebble, a pinecone.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 335, 'Turn a scribble into a funny creature by adding eyes, legs and a smile.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 336, 'Read the story of how an old painting traveled through time, then look at the painting again.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 337, 'Pay attention to the colors in a crowd on a busy street or train, the coats, bags and umbrellas.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 338, 'Glance at the shape of a poem on the page before reading a word, its long lines and short ones.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 339, 'Notice which room in your home feels most beautiful and ask yourself why.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 340, 'Photograph a friend''s hands while they make something, like knitting, cooking or writing.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 341, 'Gather three images of art you love into one folder on your phone, a tiny museum of your own.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 342, 'Step onto your doorstep on a clear night and enjoy the moon or a few bright stars.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 343, 'Listen to the same short piece of music in the morning and at night and notice how it changes.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 344, 'Spend ten minutes making one drawer or shelf look neat and pleasant to open.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 345, 'Notice one beautiful thing about a place you think of as plain, then tell someone.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 346, 'Compare a painting with a photograph of the same kind of place, and see what each one notices.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 347, 'Visit a quiet courtyard, cloister or place of worship that welcomes visitors and enjoy how it was built for calm.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 348, 'Sing a round or a simple song with a child, or teach one to them.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 349, 'Invite someone you live with to choose one small change that would make a shared room lovelier.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 350, 'Ask yourself which kinds of beauty restore you most: nature, music, color or faces.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 351, 'Step close to a mosaic, in a station, a church or a photo, and see how tiny pieces become one picture.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 352, 'Let your eyes rest on the green of one indoor plant for a slow minute.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 353, 'Share a single song with someone in the same room and listen without talking until it ends.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 354, 'Prepare your bedroom for sleep with soft light and one lovely thing in view.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 355, 'Describe something beautiful you saw today to a friend on the phone, in enough detail that they can picture it.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 356, 'Thank an artwork quietly, in your head, for the moment of calm it gave you.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 357, 'Squint at a busy view, a street or a garden, until it blurs into soft shapes of color.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 358, 'Thank a musician, teacher or performer whose work brought you joy, in person or with a note.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 359, 'Celebrate the first warm day of spring by opening the windows wide and letting fresh air move the curtains.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 360, 'Gather a few things you have made, drawn or photographed lately and set them out together for a moment.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 361, 'Close a busy afternoon by choosing which painting you would hang in your own home, if you could have any.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 362, 'End the day by naming one beautiful thing you saw, out loud to someone or to yourself.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 363, 'Finish the day by reading the lyrics of a song you love as if they were a poem.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 364, 'Step back at the end of the day and enjoy one corner of your home you made lovely.'),
  ('enjoying-art-and-beauty', 365, 'Smile at the next beautiful thing you notice and let it be a small gift to your day.')
) as v(slug, day, task)
join public.challenge_templates t on t.slug = v.slug;
